    "title": "Shortest Distance Between Two Skew Lines in 3D",
    "question": "Find the shortest distance between the two skew lines:\n$$L_1: \\frac{x-1}{2} = \\frac{y-2}{3} = \\frac{z-3}{4}$$\n$$L_2: \\frac{x-2}{3} = \\frac{y-4}{4} = \\frac{z-5}{5}$$",
